  - Press the corresponding inputs with your arrow keys or face buttons to make the fight easier!
  - You got a bite! Press the inputs in the correct order to reel it in! Next time it will be timed!
  - Press the button to keep going. If you need to see the tutorial again press [Escape] then start tutorial.
